---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import DiagnosticContactForm from "../../components/DiagnosticContactForm.astro";
import { seo } from "../../seo";
import DiagnosticInvestment from "../../components/DiagnosticInvestment.astro";

const meta = seo.ninetyNinety.en;
---

<Layout {...meta} lang="en">
    <article class="prose prose-lg prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 uppercase mb-4">
            Express Diagnostic
        </p>
        <h1 class="font-bold text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
            90 minutes to bring order to the present. 90 days to move forward.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-10">
            A working conversation that turns a confusing web-project problem into clear priorities and an actionable plan.
        </p>
        <a href="#consulta" class="no-underline inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-neutral-900 px-5 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white hover:bg-neutral-700 dark:bg-white dark:text-black dark:hover:bg-neutral-200 transition-colors">
            Tell me what you need to solve <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

        <section class="mt-16">
            <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-12 mb-5">What it is</h2>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">The Express Diagnostic is a 90-minute video call to understand what is holding back your site, product, or team. We do not begin with a predetermined solution; we first identify the problem that truly matters to your business.</p>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">Within 2–3 business days, you receive a document with objectives, key issues, priorities, and a three-month roadmap your team can execute independently or with my support.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-14 mb-5">Who it is for</h2>
            <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5">For people making decisions about a website, web product, or digital prototype who need clarity on the next step. It is especially useful when:</p>
            <ul class="list-none pl-0 space-y-4 mb-6">
                <li class="pl-4 border-l-4 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">Your team or provider is moving more slowly than expected.</li>
                <li class="pl-4 border-l-4 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">Priorities conflict and nobody knows what to solve first.</li>
                <li class="pl-4 border-l-4 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">Your site is slow, fragile, or difficult to maintain.</li>
                <li class="pl-4 border-l-4 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">A launch is approaching and the plan needs to come together.</li>
                <li class="pl-4 border-l-4 border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">You built an AI prototype, validated the idea with your team or partners, and now need to decide how to turn it into a real product.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-14 mb-5">What you receive</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-4 mb-6">
                <li>A shared reading of your current situation.</li>
                <li>The three issues that need attention first.</li>
                <li>Quick actions and priorities to keep the team focused.</li>
                <li>A 90-day roadmap, organized by month.</li>
                <li>A short review call, if the plan needs clarification.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <DiagnosticInvestment lang="en" />

        <section>
            <h2 class="font-bold text-2xl mt-14 mb-5">How it works</h2>
            <ol class="list-none pl-0 space-y-7 mb-6">
                <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-bold text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><strong class="block">Tell me about your situation</strong><span>Tell me what's happening, what you've tried so far, and which website or product is involved.</span></div></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-bold text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><strong class="block">Let's talk for 15 minutes, free of charge</strong><span>We'll have a brief call to get to know each other, understand your situation, and decide if moving forward with the diagnostic makes sense for both of us.</span></div></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-bold text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><strong class="block">We confirm your booking</strong><span>If we agree to move forward, we'll schedule your 90-minute session. You'll confirm your booking and receive a short preparation questionnaire.</span></div></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-bold text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true">04</span><div><strong class="block">We work together for 90 minutes</strong><span>We'll review your goals, priorities, team, and technical context to identify the problem that really needs solving.</span></div></li>
                <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-bold text-neutral-400" aria-hidden="true">05</span><div><strong class="block">You receive your roadmap</strong><span>Within 2–3 business days, you'll receive a clear, actionable plan for the next 90 days.</span></div></li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <DiagnosticContactForm lang="en" />
    </article>
</Layout>
